WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:08.470
So it's not only Chris Matthews on MSNBC that
in his panic about Bernie Sanders, recent

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:13.790
primary and caucus successes likened Bernie
to Nazis. We've actually been covering the

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:19.380
disinformation propaganda and the memes that
have been spreading and the American right

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:25.470
is in as much of a panic over Bernie Sanders
as his establishment, corporate media and

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:30.470
the democratic party establishment and the
right is now starting to spread disinformation,

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:32.820
equating Bernie to Hitler.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:38.350
Now I want to look at one example today, which
in six different ways suggests that Bernie

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:44.670
Sanders is like Adolf Hitler. Now we have
to suspend disbelief for a moment because

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:49.940
when you say the Jewish candidate whose family
members were killed in the Holocaust by Hitler's

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:55.789
Nazis is like Hitler immediately, most people
would say, that doesn't make any sense, David.

00:00:55.789 --> 00:01:00.089
Let's ignore that for now and just look at
what they assert. Let's look at these one

00:01:00.089 --> 00:01:07.310
by one. The meme claims that both Hitler and
Bernie believe state power will fix their

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:13.630
respective countries. It's important to point
out that Bernie Sanders has no interest in

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:19.170
increasing state power, and in fact, Bernie
has been critical of how Donald Trump has

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:24.060
exposed that the executive branch probably
has too much power because Trump has been

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:29.470
able to completely flout and ignore laws and
norms. And do whatever the hell he wants.

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:36.110
So it is simply not true that Bernie is looking
to increase state power, uh, for these hegemonic

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:40.480
authoritarian reasons that Hitler wanted to
do. That. What Bernie believes is that government

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:46.130
involvement in a sensible and controlled way
will make some of our systems better function.

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:49.950
There are systems that aren't working well,
that have turned over too much power to the

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:54.220
rich and to corporations at the expense of
the average American. Bernie believes government

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:59.590
involvement in those systems will be better
for the average person. Secondly, they argue

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:05.770
Bernie and Hitler are the same because they
both proposed gun control. Now, this relates

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:13.480
to a meme that has spread that the Jews were
disarmed by Nazis, and if the Jews had not

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:18.810
been disarmed by Nazis and had rifles and
handguns, they could have successfully resisted

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:25.010
world war II period. That has been widely
debunked. It's an entire, we could do an hour

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:29.400
just on that, but it is both factually wrong
and it's wrong in its conclusions.

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:35.950
Bernie wants sensible gun control that most
Americans agree with. Gun control was already

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:41.859
strict in Germany before Hitler came to power.
Historians agree that guns would not have

00:02:41.859 --> 00:02:47.150
allowed the Jews who made up just 1% of the
German population at the time to resist the

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:53.269
third Reich. And the idea that 1% of the population
with pistols and handguns was going to take

00:02:53.269 --> 00:03:00.029
out, take out a very well armed police state,
uh, that ultimately became and worked with

00:03:00.029 --> 00:03:05.810
and mold it into melded into the third Reich
is silly at its face and has been widely debunked.

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:10.519
The third bullet point is both Hitler and
Bernie promise political revolution. Now in

00:03:10.519 --> 00:03:16.240
a sense, so did Donald Trump a revolution
where the swamp would be drained? Political

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:23.109
insiders would no longer have power. He failed
to do it. But this idea of revolution is so

00:03:23.109 --> 00:03:25.829
vague that it becomes meaningless.

00:03:25.829 --> 00:03:32.230
Hitler's revolution was one of a hegemonic
Germany invading other countries and killing

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:39.140
Jews likening it to Bernie Sanders, wanting
the U S to be more like the social democracy

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:46.139
of Denmark where people get healthcare and
public college paid for through taxes is laughable.

00:03:46.139 --> 00:03:52.389
It is a semantic game that they are playing.
Number four, they bring out the term socialist.

00:03:52.389 --> 00:03:56.790
The right-wing disinformation meme says, Hey,
Hitler called himself a socialist and Bernie

00:03:56.790 --> 00:04:02.779
calls himself a socialist. Now, of course,
national socialist abbreviated as Nazi has

00:04:02.779 --> 00:04:08.200
nothing to do whatsoever with democratic socialism
or in reality, what's social democracy? That's

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:13.560
what Bernie Sanders is proposing. This is
a semantic confusion that's being used to

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:19.019
trick low information. People who don't really
know much by throwing the word socialism and

00:04:19.019 --> 00:04:25.240
without any context. Number five, Hitler blamed
Jews for Germany's problems. While Bernie

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:30.289
blames the rich for America's problems, this
is a really important one.

00:04:30.289 --> 00:04:35.430
Bernie is not so much blaming the rich for
problems. Now, even if Bernie was blaming

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:39.970
the rich, blaming the rich is very different
than blaming the Jews, but put that aside

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:47.819
for a second. Bernie doesn't blame the rich
Bernie points to the super rich as evidence

00:04:47.819 --> 00:04:51.870
that the system is not working. It needs to
be reformed. When Bernie says, look at the

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:57.419
super rich and corporations who often pay
little or less in taxes compared to people

00:04:57.419 --> 00:05:02.030
who are just middle-class, that's evidence
that the system isn't working. The rich are

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:08.940
a side effect. The rich aren't the problem
as individuals. A very, very deceptive component.

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:15.449
And then lastly, both Hitler and Bernie wanted
heavily regulated economies. And again, this

00:05:15.449 --> 00:05:22.930
is just a semantic game. A regulated economy
could mean anything from a communist, centrally

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:28.520
planned economy to social democracy or even
a totalitarian police state. Hitler wanted

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:33.900
to get involved in the minutia of people's
everyday lives in the authoritarian sense,

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:36.509
determine who gets to live, who gets to procreate.

00:05:36.509 --> 00:05:41.930
Bernie wants to regulate the economy to prevent
bad actors in industry and bad actors who

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:46.900
limit the average person's ability to just
live a happy life and pursue happiness. So

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:50.440
this is one of those examples where you see
the full list with the deceptive language

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:56.289
and you start to think, man, may, maybe Bernie
is like Hitler. In some ways. The Mirasee

00:05:56.289 --> 00:06:02.480
superficial analysis confirms that this is
merely disinformation and, uh, something that

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:09.400
we need to protect ourselves against given
the nature of the nature and the scope of

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:14.960
the disinformation that is floating around
already in the democratic primary. Um, very,

00:06:14.960 --> 00:07:13.680
very ugly stuff. But we will do our best to
debunk it.

